WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:12.300
Noura raises the alarm calmly, then gives people a direction along the approved route, not just a warning - and thanks them for keeping it clear.

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:19.900
Noura: Please move this way, towards Gate C - thank you for keeping the route clear.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.500
An authorised kiosk employee switches off if it's safe and steps out.

4
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.400
Kiosk employee: I couldn't reach the gas valve.

5
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:39.900
When the gas can't be reached, Noura reports it as not done - she doesn't assume it was.

